## Section

```elixir
#require ExMan

#IO.puts(ExMan.markdown_path())

#IO.puts(ExMan.markdown_path_fun(__ENV__))

ExMan.loadrules(__ENV__)
```

The rules are collected from the markdown cell build immediatly under a section labeled 'RULES'. 
All the content until EOF, a section labeled 'END RULES', or a new code cell is collected and
analyzed by `ExMan.loadrules(__ENV__)`. Alternatively, for formatting purposes, the cell can be 
prefaced by \```elixir (or python or erlang) and end with \``` without any addtional steps.

## RULES

